WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.520
Excerpts from Julius Dein's latest video...

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:27.860
It was viewed more than 24 million times
on Facebook within the space of a few days.

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:29.720
Dein is only 23.

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:35.100
But he's already learned how to attract a
huge Internet audience with simple magic tricks.

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:40.820
“My dad doesn’t get it.

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:43.380
He doesn’t have any form of social media.

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:46.890
So when I told him, my video got 50 million
views on Facebook last week.

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:50.370
He’s like: Oh, cool, how is exams going?

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:52.600
This was when I first doing videos."

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:57.500
It all started 2 years ago.

00:00:58.060 --> 00:01:01.960
Dein started making his first video clips
when he was an exchange student in California.

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:07.640
While his fellow students were doing internships,
he was working to boost his online presence.

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:13.500
Back home, he improved his tricks, finsihed
his course of study and devoted himself to magic.

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:19.770
Especially popular are the videos in which
he uses tricks to grab women's attention.

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:24.880
His series „HOW TO IMPRESS A GIRL WITH A
MAGIC TRICK“ has attracted almost 150 Millionen hits.

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:33.000
Dein performed as a magician at small parties
while still a boy.

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:36.420
He's come a long way since then.

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:39.140
These days he has 8 million facebook followers.

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.040
“ I seen your videos, men!"

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:43.039
“How are you doing?”

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:44.460
“ You are the best magician, man!”

00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:52.420
Today, Dein is on the go near his home in
East London to try out some new tricks live.

00:01:55.040 --> 00:02:00.020
“When I’m trying to create a video that
has 50 million views you want people giving

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:01.180
me good reactions.

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:08.360
And usually those kind of people that look
confident, look friendly, look approachable."

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:18.220
A few seconds later, Dein finds a good location
in front of a barber shop.

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:22.860
Aside from an audience, all he needs for the
trick is a marker - and some magic of course.

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:24.920
“Three, two, [whistles]…

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:25.420
boom.

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:26.600
X vanished.

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:30.980
Turn your hand over."

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:41.360
“What you see on the internet is a one to
five minute piece, that looks flawless, but

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:44.310
this things takes hours and hours and hours.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:49.510
Everything from getting the right team, getting
to the right location and to learning the

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:53.980
right tricks, which can take ten to literally
hundreds of hours to learn."

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:55.520
"How long has it been since you lost your hair?"

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:58.180
Dein is known for pranks as well as magic
tricks.

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:22.380
Even his grandmother isn't safe from becoming
a target of his jokes.

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:28.120
With 92 million views on Facebook, this clip
set a record.

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:32.540
Dein is constantly monitoring what his followers
like to ensure that his next clip goes viral, too.

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:43.380
“Catchy introduction, huge, snappy engaging
content consistently, thumbnails, titles, not

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:47.020
too long, it’s a formula.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:50.520
It is very important to follow the formula
how to get viral.”

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:56.960
The formula works. Julius Dein is the world's
most successful online magician.

00:03:57.580 --> 00:04:01.800
But he still a long way for earning the big
bucks that the top magicians do.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:12.880
“If you are looking at the biggest magician
in the world.

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:16.350
You’ve got David Copperfield, who made the
Statue of Liberty disappear.

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:19.280
You’ve got Criss Angel who walked across
the water.

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:23.380
I would like to create something with a huge
publicity stunt where I do stuff that takes

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:24.820
it up a level.

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:29.020
At the moment my magic doesn’t cost much
to make and I can only imagine what I could

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:31.300
make if I had huge budgets.”

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:36.600
But in the meantime Dein gets big results from
small tricks.

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:43.380
1.4 billion views on Facebook, Instagram, Snapchat and Youtube are certainly nothing to sneeze at.

